    "description": "The Banking Accounts Limits API provides access to the current limits associated with various banking accounts. This API allows users to retrieve information about transaction limits, withdrawal limits, and other critical thresholds that govern banking operations. It is particularly useful for financial applications that need to inform users of their account capabilities. Typical consumers of this API include banking applications, financial service providers, and fintech solutions looking to enhance user awareness regarding account limits.",
